## Folder Description

backend/ – Contains the backend application and APIs.
frontend/ – Contains the user interface files.
database/ – Contains database and SQL files.
docs/ – Contains project documentation, diagrams, and screenshots.
README.md – Contains project overview and information.
PROJECT_STRUCTURE.md– Describes the project folder structure.
